	(text "Bank 1: OUT1-4 / TIM5 PA0-PA3 / select PD11. Bank 2: OUT5-8 / TIM4 PD12-PD15 / select PD3.\nSelect LOW: LV8T245 5V servo PWM. Select HIGH: direct 3.3V timer path, including ESC replies; buffer path disconnected.\nPD10 ACTUATOR_OE_N HIGH disconnects BOTH banks and disables buffer. Pullup gives reset disable; header pulldowns set LOW.\nChange mode only while disabled/disarmed: stop timers, OE HIGH, select path, configure timer, then OE LOW.\nDShot mode: no 5V pullup; ESC must accept 3.3V commands and return <=3.3V. Keep select fixed throughout TX/RX.\n5V HIGH follows V5_SYS under load; qualify rail drops and cable edges. Custom firmware + DShot capture/DMA tests required."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 238 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a02ce154-9ab9-5f90-ab56-0be9d9b1fa14")
	)
